<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Reproducibility on WM's Blog</title><link>https://wins-m.github.io/679/en/tags/reproducibility/</link><description>Recent content in Reproducibility on WM's Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 22 Nov 2025 16:18:58 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://wins-m.github.io/679/en/tags/reproducibility/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Experiment Tracking &amp; Doc Writing</title><link>https://wins-m.github.io/679/en/posts/2025/exp_track/</link><pubDate>Sat, 22 Nov 2025 16:18:58 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wins-m.github.io/679/en/posts/2025/exp_track/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#experiment-tracking--doc-writing" &gt;Experiment Tracking &amp;amp; Doc Writing&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#experiment" &gt;Experiment&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#1-use-configs-for-all-pipeline-level-hyperparameters" &gt;1. Use configs: for all pipeline-level hyperparameters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#2-save-results-config-logs-prediction-metrics-panels" &gt;2. Save results: config, logs, prediction, metrics, (panels)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#3-have-one-script-to-compare-ipynb" &gt;3. Have one script to compare: &lt;code&gt;*.ipynb&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#weekly-doc-writing" &gt;Weekly Doc Writing&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#structure" &gt;Structure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;!-- ---&#10;marp: true&#10;theme: default&#10;size: 16:9&#10;style: |&#10; section {&#10; font-size: 20px;&#10; }&#10; h1 {&#10; font-size: 36px;&#10; }&#10; h2 {&#10; font-size: 28px;&#10; }&#10; h3 {&#10; font-size: 24px;&#10; }&#10; p, li {&#10; font-size: 20px;&#10; }&#10; img {&#10; width: 75%;&#10; }&#10;footer: swmao @ Futuristic&#10;paginate: true --&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;!--_paginate: false--&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="experiment-tracking--doc-writing"&gt;&#10; Experiment Tracking &amp;amp; Doc Writing&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#experiment-tracking--doc-writing"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="experiment"&gt;&#10; Experiment&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#experiment"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Use configs&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Save results&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Have one script to compare&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-use-configs-for-all-pipeline-level-hyperparameters"&gt;&#10; 1. Use configs: for all pipeline-level hyperparameters&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#1-use-configs-for-all-pipeline-level-hyperparameters"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Base config: captures every optional feature in the pipeline, shared across experiments&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Experiment config: modifies 1–2 items from the base config (overrides)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Stored config: for each experiment run, make sure it can be traced back later&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Recommend using &lt;code&gt;*.yaml&lt;/code&gt; for better readability &lt;a href="https://github.com/MagicianQuant/TheMagicQuant/blob/swmao_dev/alpha_model_hyperliquid/configs/training_configs.yaml" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;example&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>